{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-30-1","title":"Jeremiah 30:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God shews Jeremiah the return of the Jews. 4 After their trouble they shall have deliverance. 10 He comforts Jacob. 18 Their return shall be gracious. 23 Wrath shall fall on the wicked.</p>\n<p>Cir.A.M. 3417. B.C. 587. 1:1,2; 26:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-30-2","title":"Jeremiah 30:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>36:2-4,32; 51:60-64; Ex 17:14; De 31:19,22-27; Job 19:23,24 Isa 8:1; 30:8; Da 12:4; Hab 2:2,3; Ro 15:4; 1Co 10:11; 2Pe 1:21 Re 1:11,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-30-3","title":"Jeremiah 30:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the days. 23:5,7; 31:27,31,38; 33:14,15; Lu 17:22; 19:43; 21:6; Heb 8:8 that I. 10,18; 27:22; 29:14; 31:23; 32:37,44; 33:7-11,26; De 30:3 Ps 53:6; Eze 39:25,26; Joe 3:1; Am 9:14,15; Ob 1:19,20; Zep 3:20 and I. 16:15; 23:8; 27:11; Ezr 3:1,8,12; Eze 20:42; 28:25,26; 36:24 Eze 37:21-25; 39:27,28; 47:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-30-5","title":"Jeremiah 30:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>a voice. 4:15-20; 6:23,24; 8:19; 9:19; 25:36; 31:15,16; Isa 5:30; 59:11 Am 5:16-18; 8:10; Zep 1:10,11; Lu 19:41-44; 21:25,26; 23:29-30 of fear, and not of peace. or, there is fear, and not peace. 46:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-30-6","title":"Jeremiah 30:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>a man. Heb. a male. every. 4:31; 6:24; 13:21; 22:23; 49:24; 50:43; Ps 48:6; Isa 13:6-9; 21:3 Da 5:6; Ho 13:13; Mic 4:9,10; Joh 16:21,22; 1Th 5:3 paleness. Isa 29:22; Joe 2:6; Na 2:10</p>"}